    {
      "point": "The interim loan program for C H S is facing significant risk of default due to the expiration of its obligations, which could lead to foreclosure proceedings by D C H S. Executive staff has outlined a 'remedy in lieu' strategy: King County would assume property ownership via Facilities Management Division (FMD), while C H S forfeits development rights. This outcome is tied to financial volatility and resource limitations.",
